                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./49:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Geissler</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-03-16T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 16,
                                1928—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>21. John D. MacGregor, Vice President Pan American Airways, will arrive by train
                    March 20 for the purpose of obtaining a transport concession. Please render him
                    all possible and proper assistance.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
